# Alert Dialog

Modal confirmation that ignores overlay clicks (Escape still closes).

<div class="mt-4 rounded-xl border bg-card p-6 text-card-foreground">
	<AlertDialog.Root>
		<AlertDialog.Trigger class="inline-flex h-9 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-md bg-primary px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-primary-foreground transition-colors hover:brightness-110">Delete item</AlertDialog.Trigger>
